%% Phase2 / post / G-05 转发与批量发送结果
%% Helix owners: forward.rs; event/post/forward.rs; ws/handlers/post.rs; port_reply/message_v3_post.rs
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as PC Angular UI
  participant Gate as messageV3ImGate
  participant Native as Tauri/Native
  participant FFI as Mobile FFI
  participant Web as Browser/Web
  participant E as ExecutionShell/Tick
  participant IM as helix-im
  participant Host as driver-host
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant Go as Go IM server
  participant WS as WS inbound
  participant Sink as EventSink/adapter

  alt PC Tauri 入口
    UI->>Gate: relayMessages(postIds,targetChannelIds,mode)
    Gate->>Native: invokeAccepted("im_relay_messages", payload)
    Native->>E: Tick::Command(AppCommand)
  else Mobile FFI 入口
    FFI->>E: helix_command("im_relay_messages", payload)
  else Web 入口
    Web->>E: invoke("im_relay_messages", payload)
  end
  E->>IM: step(Tick::Command)
  IM->>IM: 校验 target 集合/mode，分配 batch correlation
  IM->>Host: Effect::Persist Get source posts
  Host->>DB: 只读 source durable rows
  DB-->>Host: PortReply(source rows)
  Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(source rows)
  E->>IM: build target requests without rewriting source identity
  par target A
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create(target A)
    Host->>Go: relay request A
    Go-->>Host: 2xx admission A
  and target B
    IM->>Host: Effect::Http POST /posts/create(target B)
    Host->>Go: relay request B
    Go-->>Host: 2xx admission B
  end
  IM->>Sink: Emit im:posts:batch-result(admissions, per-target status)
  Go-->>WS: WS action=post(target A, new id)
  Go-->>WS: WS action=post(target B, new id)
  par target A authority
    WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post A)
    E->>IM: dispatch post A
    IM->>Host: PersistAtomic(message A + channel A + member A + cursor)
    Host->>DB: commit target A identity
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(A PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(A)
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet A
    Host->>DB: readback A
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(A readback)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:received(A) + im:channel:update(A)
  and target B authority
    WS->>E: Tick::Inbound(post B)
    E->>IM: dispatch post B
    IM->>Host: PersistAtomic(message B + channel B + member B + cursor)
    Host->>DB: commit target B identity
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(B PersistOk)
    Host->>E: Tick::PortReply(B)
    IM->>Host: Persist ScopedGet B
    Host->>DB: readback B
    DB-->>Host: PortReply(B readback)
    IM->>Sink: Emit im:post:received(B) + im:channel:update(B)
  end
  Sink-->>UI: Native bus renders each independent target message
  Sink-->>FFI: batch raw per-target events
  Sink-->>Web: EventBatch raw per-target events
  alt target admission or authority failure
    IM->>Sink: Emit batch-result failure for only failed target
  end
  Note over DB,IM: source row/source identity never changes；each target owns a new message id and viewer-local unread.
